        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer grid, class 3</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer grid, class 3
Sewer system for municipal wastewater treatment plant capacity class 3 with an average per-captia equivalent PCE (Einwohnergleichwert) of 24'864. Average length 109.4 km. This is the average plant size in Switzerland. The lifetime is 100 years including a renovation after 70 years.;
Synonyms: municipal sewer infrastructure for capacity class 3; 
UUID: d30ff55c-cadd-3d65-bc68-2fc14d754a08
Infrastructure materials for municipal sewer system, transports, dismantling.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Underground sewer system with pipes
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d30ff55c-cadd-3d65-bc68-2fc14d754a08.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
